  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GTFP ATRI BPM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project builds on GTFP&apos;s global platform, increasing access to trade finance to emerging markets and developing economies. The Project will provide increased access to trade finance to the Issuing Bank&apos;s customers, including both corporates and SMEs. On the market side, the project will further connect the Issuing Bank&apos;s cross border connections, increasing Mauritania&apos;s integration through both financial and real sector channels. The Project will strengthen BPMs ability to link more traders to other markets in a country where trade plays a key role in the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment project is with Banque Populaire de Mauritanie (BPM or the Bank) in a form of unfunded trade facility of up to US$10 million equivalent with a maximum tenor of 6 months (the Project).</narrative>
  </description>
